# Live completed-solds API. When unset, Comps stays empty (no sample prices).
# Query params sent: cardCode, language (EN|JP), type, grade, printNote, completed=true
# Response: JSON array or { solds: [] } of completed solds. Each row needs:
#   id, cardCode, soldAt, channel (fixed|auction), completed=true,
#   priceAud, priceOriginal, currencyOriginal, type
#   sourceUrl (or listingUrl), optional sourceLabel
# Prefer PriceCharting eBay solds, then eBay sold. AUD first; stamp FX on conversions.
# There is no keyless public solds API in this app — point this at Chamber comps.php
# (or your own backend). Public URL only. No secrets.
#
# Default / example (copy to `.env` for local; EAS builds set this in eas.json):
EXPO_PUBLIC_COMPS_API_URL=https://whitesmoke-woodpecker-609130.hostingersite.com/api/comps.php
